// Local signing identity. Checked in empty on purpose.
//
// With no team, Xcode signs ad-hoc ("Sign to Run Locally"). That runs, but the
// code identity changes on every rebuild, so macOS re-prompts for camera access
// and for Keychain access to the enrolled template.
//
// Set your Developer ID team here to get a stable identity:
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
